d 'LATEXLOG': module to build LaTeX log files from within Stata
d
d   latexlog builds complete LaTeX reports from within Stata. It
d creates .tex documents containing text, sections, exported Stata
d graphs, groups of subfigures, and tables from Stata’s collect
d framework. Its optional pdf subcommand compiles the report with
d pdflatex. 
d
d KW: log
d KW: LaTeX
d KW: publication quality
d
d Requires: Stata version 18; optionally estout from SSC
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260828
d
d Author: Johannes Schmieder,  Boston University
d Support: email johannes@@bu.edu
d
f latexlog.ado
f latexlog_run.ado
f latexlog.sthlp
f latexlog_test.do
